    },
    {
      "displayText": "朱红色传说",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67317EA282724F208BF40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "靛蓝色传说",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975B84DD82724F208BF40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正在思考追赶安馨儿时误入的\n奇妙的空间是什么的时候……\n收到了来自乌羽的召唤。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B635728601D80038FFD8D765B8999A8513F65F68BEF51657684000A5947599976847A7A95F4662F4EC04E48768465F6501920262026000A653652304E86676581EA4E4C7FBD768453EC552430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "决定与锈蚀组一起推进\n“异次元密阿雷”的调查。\n跟在安馨儿身边的宝可梦胡帕，\n它的能力似乎会成为关键。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B35B9A4E0E950886807EC44E008D7763A88FDB000A201C5F026B2151435BC6963F96F7201D76848C0367E53002000A8DDF57285B8999A8513F8EAB8FB976845B9D53EF68A680E15E15FF0C000A5B83768480FD529B4F3C4E4E4F1A62104E3A5173952E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "悠闲的清晨时光随着\n剧烈的开门声戛然而止……！\n看来有必要让情绪激动的\n春紫冷静下来。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A095F276846E05666865F65149968F7740000A526770C876845F0095E858F0621B7136800C6B6220262026FF01000A770B676567095FC589818BA960C57EEA6FC052A87684000A66257D2B51B797594E0B676530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "旅馆Ｚ迎来安馨儿和可尔妮，\n变得热闹了起来。\n异次元密阿雷的调查\n似乎还会继续下去。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65C59986FF3A8FCE67655B8999A8513F548C53EF5C1459AEFF0C000A53D85F9770ED95F94E868D7767653002000A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F776848C0367E5000A4F3C4E4E8FD84F1A7EE77EED4E0B53BB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "异次元密阿雷的调查暂停了。\n在等待乌羽联系的同时，\n将陪安馨儿和可尔妮游览密阿雷。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F026B2151435BC6963F96F776848C0367E56682505C4E863002000A57287B495F854E4C7FBD80547CFB7684540C65F6FF0C000A5C06966A5B8999A8513F548C53EF5C1459AE6E3889C85BC6963F96F730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作战会议室里本该空无一人，\n却突然传来了可疑的声响……\n莫非是谁藏在那里吗？\n谨慎地确认一下房间里面吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C62184F1A8BAE5BA491CC672C8BE57A7A65E04E004EBAFF0C000A53747A8171364F2067654E8653EF7591768458F054CD20262026000A83AB975E662F8C0185CF572890A391CC5417FF1F000A8C28614E5730786E8BA44E004E0B623F95F491CC9762542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "异次元密阿雷的调查正逐步推进。\n搜寻扭洞的精度随之提高，\n现在可以调查更高级别的\n异次元密阿雷了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F026B2151435BC6963F96F776848C0367E56B6390106B6563A88FDB3002000A641C5BFB626D6D1E76847CBE5EA6968F4E4B63D09AD8FF0C000A73B0572853EF4EE58C0367E566F49AD87EA7522B7684000A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F74E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "早餐时间已经过了，\n但琵鲁还是不想从房间里出来。\n头巾混混好像带来了什么信息，\n去房间里看看情况吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E9991065F695F45DF27ECF8FC74E86FF0C000A4F4674359C818FD8662F4E0D60F34ECE623F95F491CC51FA67653002000A59345DFE6DF76DF7597D50CF5E2667654E864EC04E484FE1606FFF0C000A53BB623F95F491CC770B770B60C551B5542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "棱镜塔上空的巨大扭洞\n似乎正在逐渐扩大它所带来的影响。\n在危险波及到密阿雷市之前，\n必须解开异次元的谜团。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "68F1955C58544E0A7A7A76845DE85927626D6D1E000A4F3C4E4E6B63572890106E10626959275B8362405E26676576845F7154CD3002000A5728537196696CE253CA52305BC6963F96F75E024E4B524DFF0C000A5FC5987B89E35F005F026B21514376848C1C56E230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说密阿雷市有可能\n会被异次元密阿雷吞没。\n究竟能否阻止\n不断膨胀的异次元密阿雷呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF45BC6963F96F75E02670953EF80FD000A4F1A88AB5F026B2151435BC6963F96F7541E6CA13002000A7A767ADF80FD5426963B6B62000A4E0D65AD81A880C076845F026B2151435BC6963F96F75462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正当准备入睡的时候，\n玳萝的声音响彻了旅馆Ｚ！\n是出了什么麻烦吗……？\n先去确认一下状况吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B635F5351C6590751657761768465F65019FF0C000A73B3841D768458F097F354CD5F7B4E8665C59986FF3AFF01000A662F51FA4E864EC04E489EBB70E6541720262026FF1F000A514853BB786E8BA44E004E0B72B651B55427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "基于至今收集的数据，\n分析似乎取得了巨大的进展。\n解开异次元密阿雷的谜团，\n阻止现实与异次元的融合吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57FA4E8E81F34ECA653696C676846570636EFF0C000A520667904F3C4E4E53D65F974E865DE8592776848FDB5C553002000A89E35F005F026B2151435BC6963F96F776848C1C56E2FF0C000A963B6B6273B05B9E4E0E5F026B2151437684878D5408542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "异次元的谜团已经解开，\n但安馨儿原本的目标——\n传说的宝可梦仍未找到。\n看来还需要继续调查。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F026B21514376848C1C56E25DF27ECF89E35F00FF0C000A4F465B8999A8513F539F672C768476EE680720142014000A4F208BF476845B9D53EF68A64ECD672A627E52303002000A770B67658FD8970089817EE77EED8C0367E530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "翠绿色的巨大扭洞出现了。\n此扭洞连接着安馨儿所寻找的\n传说的宝可梦烈空坐的所在地。\n准备好甜甜圈，前去捕捉吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7FE07EFF827276845DE85927626D6D1E51FA73B04E863002000A6B64626D6D1E8FDE63A577405B8999A8513F62405BFB627E7684000A4F208BF476845B9D53EF68A670C87A7A575076846240572857303002000A51C65907597D751C751C5708FF0C524D53BB635563495427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在朱红色扭洞深处\n检测到了固拉多。\n用特制食谱制作甜甜圈，\n去捕捉固拉多吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572867317EA28272626D6D1E6DF15904000A68C06D4B52304E8656FA62C9591A3002000A75287279523698DF8C3152364F5C751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB6355634956FA62C9591A5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在靛蓝色扭洞深处\n检测到了盖欧卡。\n用特制食谱制作甜甜圈，\n去捕捉盖欧卡吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728975B84DD8272626D6D1E6DF15904000A68C06D4B52304E8676D66B2753613002000A75287279523698DF8C3152364F5C751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB6355634976D66B2753615427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "响应乌羽的召唤，\n前往锈蚀组的事务所。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CD5E944E4C7FBD768453EC5524FF0C000A524D5F80950886807EC476844E8B52A1624030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备好甜甜圈，\n去调查异次元扭洞。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907597D751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB8C0367E55F026B215143626D6D1E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备好甜甜圈，\n去调查异次元扭洞。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907597D751C751C5708FF0C000A53BB8C0367E55F026B215143626D6D1E30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备好甜甜圈，\n调查异次元密阿雷。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907597D751C751C5708FF0C000A8C0367E55F026B2151435BC6963F96F730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "前往锈蚀组的事务所\n听取分析结果。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "524D5F80950886807EC476844E8B52A16240000A542C53D6520667907ED3679C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "使用超级进化，\n战胜可尔妮。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F7F75288D857EA78FDB5316FF0C000A621880DC53EF5C1459AE30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备好用异次元树果\n做出的高级别甜甜圈，\n挑战危险的异次元。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907597D75285F026B2151436811679C000A505A51FA76849AD87EA7522B751C751C5708FF0C000A631162185371966976845F026B21514330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捕捉有失控超级进化\n反应的阿勃梭鲁。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "635563496709593163A78D857EA78FDB5316000A53CD5E947684963F52C368AD9C8130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用宝可梦的招式\n命中奖励球。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75285B9D53EF68A6768462DB5F0F000A547D4E2D595652B1740330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在旅馆Z的庭院\n与春紫＆沐净对战。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
